### ==============================================================================
### Age of Empires Mobile (AOEM) - BitCash Automated Top-Up Bot REST API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3003
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3003

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Check MyBitCash Balance & Member Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bitcash/balance

### 3. Direct Query BitCash Balance (Real-time check)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bitcash/balance/check

### 4. Get BitCash Transaction Ledger History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bitcash/balance/history

### 5. Check Bot Engine Status (Idle/Busy/Waiting OTP)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bot/status

### ==============================================================================
### Top-up Order Operations
### ==============================================================================

### 6. Create & Auto-Queue Top-up Order (Locked to 99+109 Coin / 146 JPY)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/topup/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "5250140737488366145",
  "server": "Empire#239",
  "packName": "99+109 Coin",
  "priceJpy": 146,
  "autoExecute": true
}

### 7. Test Safety Guard: Reject Expensive Pack (e.g. 10,000 JPY)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/topup/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "5250140737488366145",
  "server": "Empire#239",
  "packName": "9200 Coin",
  "priceJpy": 10000,
  "autoExecute": false
}

### 8. List All Orders & Statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/topup/orders

### 9. Get Specific Order Details & Receipt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/topup/orders/AOEM-XXXXXX-XXX

### 10. Submit Manual OTP (During 12:00 - 17:00 HR testing window)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/otp/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otp": "151550"
}
